  "about": "Real loan requests signed by Klimper (TASK-140) with chia_mintOption (creatorAddress = the lender, loan = the principal) by Sage wallets on a simulated testnet11 chain; each offer was also taken by its lender through Klimper's chia_takeOffer path and accepted by that chain. Amounts in mojos (CAT units for CATs); assetId null is XCH; expiresAt and chain_time are the simulator's Unix seconds. The offer locks the collateral at an option whose creator is the lender and whose strike is the repayment, hands the option to the borrower through a quoted eve, offers the lender 1 mojo at the settlement puzzle (the tie), and requests the principal to the borrower. Regenerate with `cargo test -p tauri-plugin-klimper-xchonnect export_loan_fixtures -- --ignored`.",
